# BorrowBox Netlify Redirect Rules
# Proxies API and upload traffic to Render backend service
/api/*  https://borrowbox-backend.onrender.com/api/:splat  200!
/uploads/*  https://borrowbox-backend.onrender.com/uploads/:splat  200!
/health  https://borrowbox-backend.onrender.com/health  200!
/actuator/*  https://borrowbox-backend.onrender.com/actuator/:splat  200!
